    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Yeah, I looked at the depth profile and it seems consistent, so it's probably a hardware issue. It's just frustrating because these glitches happen at seemingly random intervals. Even after checking the calibration logs, I can't find a pattern to these sensor errors. Is there anything else that could cause such unpredictable, \"glitchy\" behavior in the electronics during deployment?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
